    {
     "op": "outcome",
     "tpl": "Stamps, signatures, a sealed collar deed. You fuck {{n}} that night with the papers on the nightstand — slow, deep, cumming with your name in their mouth. LEGAL ({{c.mode}}, own {{c.own}}). -$800, +12 prestige."
